  - elementId: title-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 92, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}

  - elementId: formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 108, 848, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 15.5
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>端到端时延 ＝ <span style="color:$accent">排队时延</span> ＋ <span style="color:$primary">推理时延</span>　　（目标：高效、准确地预测两者）</p>

